---
description: Separate applicant-stated facts, unresolved conditions and urgent routing from inferred eligibility.
args: { dossier: NavigationDossier; change: ServiceChange }
returns: ServiceSituation[]
---
Use only statements and current records attributable to the applicant or authorized source. Separate facts from unknowns. Do not infer disqualifying circumstances from absent documents. Preserve any urgent service flag and route it to the named staff channel without substituting a model judgment.
